<title>SINGAPORE: Datacraft wins deals fr India, Hong Kong.</title>
<headline>Datacraft wins deals fr India, Hong Kong.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Datacraft Asia said on Friday it had clinched several networking projects in India worth about Singapore $1.8 million and also one in Hong Kong for US$380,000. The company said in a statement the networking contracts were from Indian automobile manufacturer Mahindra &amp; Mahindra Ltd.</p>
<p>In Hong Kong, the contract is from Hutchison Telecom for a network through its Hong Kong subsidiary.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
